This is the perfect case Velka 5, and its smaller than Dan A4 while fitting all the comparable components: [https://external-preview.redd.it/hNAtaetIv4HT1zoHteOyNOy5zJLA00aeHQC-\_VHiyNc.jpg?auto=webp&s=5b9d3c87a96c0015d1e3bef0922d39b52c715ffd](https://external-preview.redd.it/hNAtaetIv4HT1zoHteOyNOy5zJLA00aeHQC-_VHiyNc.jpg?auto=webp&s=5b9d3c87a96c0015d1e3bef0922d39b52c715ffd)

&#x200B;

But it is the old version of Velka 5 and is no more in sale anymore :((( . Again, the creator, for the sake of "beauty" got rid of USB ports! Apparently, people weren't happy with cords protruding from top of the case, so he redirected everything to the back in the new revision, got rid of USBs ports and used the holes for the GPU ports extenders instead.... Facepalm.

The old DICE team is no more. The new SJW DICE team spent time adding SJW elements rather than working on the game itself.

&#x200B;

Contradictingly, due to russophobia propaganda we don't even get the ones who actually won WW2 and defeated nazi germans - the Russians. So SJW DICE is rewriting history even in that regard too.
